window.products.push({"id":755010,"name":"YANIBEST Satin Pillow Shams for Hair and Skin-King Size (20x36 inches) Pillow Cases-Super Soft Satin Pillowcase Covers with Envelope Closure,White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YRikto8mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"❤ 100% Polyester. ❤ PREMIUM QUALITY FABRIC : Satin refers to the weave of the fabric( how it's put together) not the fiber(what it is made of). Yanibest’s satin pillow cover utilizes 100% polyester satin to provide resilient feel with a distinctive and lustrous appearance - High quality satin is more sturdy and durable than silk pillowcases which need professional cares. ❤ GOOD FOR HAIR AND SKIN:Satin pillowcases for hair and skin benefit the condition of your beauty,have good sleeping, great for preventing wrinkles, dry skin and frizzled hair, and morning bed head. She creates less friction of your beautiful curly hairstyle and reduces hair breakage than sleeping on cotton pillowcases - Will NOT absorb moisture to help retain your shiny hair, perfect for curly hair. ❤ ENVELOPE CLOSURE END DESIGN: These pillowcases are easy to care. There is no zipper, so it's very easy to put in or take out the pillow. Satin Pillow case with envelope design, simple and stylish,prevents your pillows escaping from pillowcase during your sweet dream. ❤ EASY TO WASH: Turn the satin pillow case inside out, place inside a mesh laundry bag, and wash with a mild detergent. The cooling luxury satin pillowcase holds up great in cold delicate wash and better AIR DRY it hanging on a rack instead of tumble dry. ❤ PERFECT CUSTOMER SERVICE: Our team guarantee three months warranty for our pillowcases. If there are any problems, please do not hesitate to email us, our customer service team will work with you to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YRikto8mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YANIBEST","source_asin":"B074JWVLHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074JWVLHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074JWVLHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
