window.products.push({"id":755018,"name":"Custom-Made, Faux Wood Horizontal Window Blinds, 2 Inch Slats, Snow White, Inside Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Su25PvD5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"These window blinds are custom made to order and are not pre-made, stocked blinds. Our inside mount 2\" Faux Wood Snow White (stark white) window blinds have the rich, natural look of real wood, but offer advantages that wood cannot. Our Faux wood slats are made of a polyvinyl blend that is warp resistant and are best suited for humid conditions, making these blinds ideal for kitchens and bathrooms. Our Faux Wood material is also Greengaurd Certified for both Air Control Quality and Children and Schools. MEASURING INTRUCTIONS: Please do not use the measurements of a blind that needs replacing. Instead, please read our measuring instructions located in our photos. Our blinds are recommended for window casings that are at least 3\" deep because if less than that, the blinds will protrude and you will be able to see the metal installation brackets from a side angle (VALANCES DO NOT COME WITH CORNER PIECES.)All computer monitors are different from one another, therefore, the colors that you see online may not be 100% accurate to what you see in person. We STRONGLY RECOMMEND requesting FREE COLOR SAMPLES from us so that you are completely satisfied, please call (678)745-4113 to request free samples or Contact Us on Amazon. DELTA BLINDS SUPPLY'S RETURN POLICY: Buyers pay for return shipping, a 30% restocking fee on all blind returns as they are all custom cut to size to order. Before placing your order, please verify and confirm the sizes and colors you are ordering are accurate so that you are completely satisfied. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Su25PvD5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Blinds Supply","source_asin":"B0099SXBD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0099SXBD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0099SXBD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755019,"name":"Funkrin Insulated Coffee Travel Mug with Ceramic Coating, 16oz Personalized Tumbler with Flip Lid, Vacuum Stainless Steel Leak-Proof Thermos Flask Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hXuaCzbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Quality Ceramic Coating: Your beverages should taste as you expect. Unlike stainless steel, our ceramic interior coating keeps your drinks pure and free from lingering odors and oils. You will not have to worry about that unpleasant metal taste in your mouth. We only use the best, corrosion-free materials. The mug is safe for coffee, tea, wine, milk and more. Nice Gift: This ceramic tumbler has a beautiful personalized pattern and is a great gift for your family, friends, partner, etc. This coffee tumbler will have immediate sentimental value beyond just one's favorite caffeinated drink. Hand it out during birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving, or any other day of the year! Note:Hand Wash Only With Soapy Hot Water. Not Available For Microwave and Machine wash. Top Quality Material: This double-walled, vacuum-sealed water bottle is copper plated with thick, professional-grade stainless steel. The lid is made of BPA-free plastic which is durable and food-safe. Fits Most Cup Holders: The coffee mug has a handle and is easy to carry. And yet, it still fits in almost any cup holder for secure transport. This makes it an ideal mug to use for commuting. Longer Insulation Time: The Funkrin travel mug's double-walled vacuum insulation can keep beverages hot or cold for 6 hours. It's perfect for the office, travel, camping, and parties. Note:Heat retention after 6 hours is 140 degree Fahrenheit. Rating is based on water at a starting temperature of 203 degree Fahrenheit at a room temperature of 77 degree Fahrenheit. Leakproof Design: The coffee travel mug is very convenient for drinking, just slide down and press the button to open the flip lid; After closing the flip lid, slide the button up to lock the lid completely, then you can put it in your car, bag, and backpack without fear of leakage.Note:After filling hot water, leave the flip-lid open for seconds to release internal steam pressure, doing so to ensure no leakage. Hassle-Free Service: We run a fast, free, and accessible service. We are responsible for all the products we sell; please contact us If you have any product questions. Our after-sale team will respond to your questions and complaints in the earliest opportunities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hXuaCzbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funkrin","source_asin":"B09XWLS8KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XWLS8KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XWLS8KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
