window.products.push({"id":755073,"name":"Mudder 3 Pack 24 Hours Magnetic Kitchen Timers with Digital Alarm Clock Timer, Loud Alarm and Big Screen (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51plfokkVzL._AC_.jpg","description":"Mudder easily operated and multi-functional 24 hours digital alarm clock with kitchen timer The Mudder 24 hours digital kitchen timer is wildly application as a long time range count-up/ down timer,a digital clock and a alarm clock. And more, you will enjoy the cute design and flexible placements with its magnetic force, stand and clip back for cooking, resting, sporting, doing facial mask, studying or office timing.  Specifications Time unit: hours, minutes, seconds Power: 1 x AAA battery (not included) Size: 2.95 x 2.76 x 0.98 inches Weight: 6.36 ounce Package: carton  Package Contents: 3 x Kitchen timer 1 x Instruction manual  Tips 1. Operate it under the conduction of its introduction. 2. It works with an AAA battery(not included). When the display is dim or alarm is not clear enough, please change the battery. 3. Press the button H, M or S over 2 seconds, it will adjust the time fast. 4. The clock just can be set in military standard time for daily 24 hours. 5. The magnet effect will be influenced by the flatness of the furniture surface, so you had better not make it adsorbed on the surface of the fridge all the time in case of falling down. 6. When you need adjust to the clock time, press \"mode\" button to the clock pattern first, then it could be adjustable. 7. Please keep the timer far away from the strong heat or the flame.  Note: 1. Buy battery within the expiration date in proper shops to make sure that the battery is clean with no leakage and no corrosion. 2. Do not reverse the positive and negative terminals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51plfokkVzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mudder","source_asin":"B01MF50495","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MF50495","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MF50495","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
