window.products.push({"id":755100,"name":"DflowerK Lemon Zester Cheese Grater Longer Razor Sharp Stainless Steel Blade with Protective Cover Great for Lemon Parmesan Cheese Chocolate Nutmeg Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616kgcoS30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Lightweight and Easier to Grind】You can easy to hold zester with one hand while holding your food product in your other hand, then use it to cheese lemon zest or grating chocolate over the top of cake, or use it grate an entire onion directly into your pan, don't require to dirty another dish ✅【Sharp Stainless Steel Blades】The super sharp blade of the grater is made of high-quality 18/8 (304) stainless steel, which is rust-free and corrosion-resistant, and it accurately cuts food. The length up to 15.8inches, longer than traditional type. You can grate the hardest cheese into fluff using without any more ado. These steel teeth are always sharp and have a long service life ✅【So Many Uses】Handheld grater can grind and peel various fruits and vegetables, such as lemon, lime, citrus, parmesan, cheese, spices, nutmeg, cinnamon, chocolate. Sprinkle fresh Parmesan over eggs, salads, or any dish for a burst of flavor. Grate other hard cheeses like Asiago, Pecorino and Padano. You can also use it to make flaky chocolate, or add coconut and nutmeg flavors to your favorite dessert ✅【Easy to Use】The ergonomic handle provides you with a soft and comfortable touch，it's very comfortable and felt natural in your hand. The slip-resistant loop at the end of the cheese grater provide stability and flexibility when grated and protect your cutting board and counter tops ✅【Easy to Clean and Store】Grade fine zester & grater is a great kitchen tool which can be hand washed or washed in the dish washer. Simply rinse Immediately after use. Use a kitchen brush on the underside of the blade to clean out tough to reach particles. 18/8 stainless steel blade of the lemon grater has a protective cover, so you can put it in the drawer and ensure that it will not be cut when cut out, it can protect your fingers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616kgcoS30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DflowerK","source_asin":"B089R15RSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R15RSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R15RSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
