window.products.push({"id":755150,"name":"Toynk Harry Potter Icons Stemless Wine Glasses, Set of 4 | 20-Ounce Tumbler Cups For Mimosas, Cocktails","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+zMPbMRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEFORE WE BEGIN OUR BANQUET, I WOULD LIKE TO SAY A FEW WORDS. AND HERE THEY ARE: NITWIT! BLUBBER! ODDMENT! TWEAK! It's a story we've come to know and love, and the parts we'll never forget: The Boy Who Lived, The Journey from Platform Nine and Three-Quarters, Moony, Wormtail, Padfoot, and Prongs, the Elder Wand, Resurrection Stone, and Invisibility Cloak. Now each part of the story is immortalized in glittering gold to toast in remembrance of a tale well told. Prepare yourself to re-enter that world of enchantment with these exclusive Harry Potter stemless wine glasses. I SOLEMNLY SWEAR THAT I AM UP TO NO GOOD Now you can toast to each successful spell, potion, or magical secret uncovered. Honor the legacy of Hogwarts. Or Beauxbatons, Castelobruxo, Durmstrang, Ilvermorny, Mahoutokoro, Uagadou, or even Koldovstoretz! Whether you love the taste of Butterbeer or you're more into Otter's Fizzy Orange Juice, these stemless wine glasses will be a magical delight. Bring the magic home with this officially licensed drinkware from the Wizarding World of Harry Potter. CARE INSTRUCTIONS Hand wash only Not dishwasher safe Not microwave safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+zMPbMRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toynk","source_asin":"B0BP87979V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP87979V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP87979V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755151,"name":"TWINY threads Stripe Cloth Napkins 100% Cotton 18\" x 18\" Set of 12 Rustic Farmhouse Napkin Washable Hotel Quality Dinner Napkins for Home, Restaurant,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ASVnmIP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY - These stripe napkins are made up of superior & luxury quality 190 GSM 100% Pure Cotton instead of cheaper alternatives like polyester. These dinner napkins are soft, absorbent and quick drying. When you get it, you'll find it worth being possessed. VALUE PACK & PERFECT SIZE - The 12-pack gives you convinience of buying table napkins set in a single package rather than purchasing each item separately. With the perfect size of 18 X 18 inches, anyone can handle these napkins with ease! LONG LASTING MATERIAL - These napkins provides you with enough long-lasting dinner napkins for all your household needs for today, tomorrow and the future! Each napkin is carefully cut and sewn from the finest quality pure cotton fabric that comes in your choice of multiple colors to choose from! MULTIPLE USES - These dinner napkins are not only good for events and business settings but make great for home settings as well! Use these as Hotel Napkins, Wedding Reception Napkins, Restaurant Napkins, Banquet Table Napkins, Cocktail Napkins and as Party Table Napkins! Helps to redesign the dinner décor instantaneously! EASY MACHINE WASHABLE - These napkins are machine washable and easy to maintain. Wash the napkins in cold water keeping it separate from dark colors. Tumble Dry at Low speed; Do not bleach or dry clean; Low Iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ASVnmIP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TWINY threads","source_asin":"B09QS4FL45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QS4FL45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QS4FL45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755152,"name":"Life Magazine - June 20, 1969 -- Cover: Joe Namath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cAnQtvo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"------------- * POSTAL REGULATIONS DO NOT ALLOW THIS TO BE MAILED MEDIA MAIL * -------------- June 20, 1969 - Life magazine is one of the world's most recognizable publications. From 1936 to 1972 the weekly publication of Life served as the nation's foremost authority on cultural trends and the state of the American experience. It ceased publication until 1978, when it returned as a monthly until the year 2000. Since then Life has returned as a weekly, published in 70 newspapers across the nation. The company is also well-known for its many books on photography, writing and, in conjunction with Time, many self-help and 'how to' volumes. Life magazine continues to be one of the most important publications in the country, both for its current issues as well as its back catalog. Researchers, designers, and the simply curious use Life magazine as a reference for style, trends, celebrity news, as well as the award-winning photography that first made the publication famous. By now there is hardly anybody in the United States who isn't familiar with both the logo (white lettering on a red rectangle) as well any number of photographs first published in the magazine, like the famous V-Day kiss in Times Square. Life magazine is dedicated to continuing its place in American publication history, and back issues of the magazine can fetch considerable figures if in good condition. The magazine has gone from being simply another magazine to a sought-after collectible. Collections of Life magazine are often found at auction. Where Life will go in the future is unknown, but its resiliency has proven to be formidable, and most experts agree that Life will remain an iconic, growing force in American culture for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cAnQtvo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unbranded","source_asin":"B000JK25FO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JK25FO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JK25FO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755153,"name":"Harmony Kingdom Timed Editions JINGLE BELL ROCK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YSXbCscFL._AC_.jpg","description":"The main photo and following description is from Harmony Kingdom's web site: Artist:Peter Calvesbert; Item No. TJSESA98; Collection Name: Timed Editions; Subset Name: Holiday; Made In: England; Status: Retired; Carving Date:1998; Release Date:4/1/1998; Retirement Date: 12/1/1998; Edition Size:19,019; Dimensions (Inches):2.99 x 1.5 x 3.46; US Issue Price: $55.00. Santa is sound asleep in his rocking chair, with a magazine on his lap featuring the top-of-the line 1999 sleigh models. Underneath his rocker is a snoozing reindeer, assorted gifts and books with such titles as “Tyson The Wimp” (by Noel Wiggins), “Nawty Kids” and “Tax Avoidance.” Peter’s mouse is also asleep, amidst the books. “Nell Doggy Heaven” is inscribed behind Santa’s head, a reference to The Perry’s dog who died while Peter was carving this piece. “Lord Lucan” on the gift tucked beneath Santa’s rocker refers to a celebrated earl who in the 1960’s allegedly murdered his children’s nanny (mistaking her for his wife) and then mysteriously disappeared. Inside, wide eyed Mad Murphy gobbles up Santa’s cookies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YSXbCscFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harmony Kingdom","source_asin":"B001MT5CPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001MT5CPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001MT5CPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755154,"name":"Sggvecsy Fall Gnomes Thanksgiving Gnome Plush Turkey Couple Dolls Handmade Mr&Mrs Swedish Tomte with Heart Envelope for Table Ornaments Gift Home Autu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+1QvL4D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIAL DESIGN: We put classic elements of fall into the gnomes by color and design,such as buffalo plaid, fall leaves skirt, heart shaped decor and envelope. The color with orange and red combination is full of fall atmosphere, easy to create a chic of holiday touch. Add these fall gnomes for a bright and colorful compliment to your autumntime centerpieces. PACKAGE & SUITABLE SIZE: You will get 2 pieces of gnome plush with different designs. The gnome hat is bend to fix the box. Please expand the hat and adjust into original shape. The total height is approx 12.6 inch, the width is about 10 inch which is a proper size to fit any place and big enough to catch everybody's eyes! PREMIUM MATERIAL: These handmade Mr & Mrs Swedish tomte are made of soft felt, wooden nose and fiber beard, which is durable and stable with soft comfortable touch, ables to use several festival seasons. At the bottom of the gnome is filled with sand to make it standing steadily. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: The turkey couple dolls are great gift for Harvest decoration, the autumn gnome brings good luck to families and is regarded as good luck. We can easily take this lucky to our best friends, children, lover, parents. Can also be used as collectible housewarming gifts. WIDELY APPLICATION: The autumn gnomes are adorable additions for you to decorate your home and room, like bookshelf, table, sofa, bed cabinets,bookcase, shelf and dining table for Thanksgiving, fall, autumn, Harvest, holiday, festival decoration. Children like the appearance mostly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+1QvL4D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0B87R1HFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87R1HFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87R1HFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755155,"name":"That's Perfect! Big Bold Stripes Decorative Throw Pillow Sham - Fits 18\" x 18\" Insert (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Usrqz4+SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring new life to your living room, family room, or den with these handmade pillow covers. These pillows can even be hand washed and pressed with a warm iron (on silk setting), if desired! The measurements denote the proper INSERT SIZE not the cover size. Decorative zippered pillow covers are designed to be up to 1\" less than stated insert size in order to give the pillow a plump, full look with pillow inserts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Usrqz4+SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"That's Perfect!","source_asin":"B015D8K5CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015D8K5CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015D8K5CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755156,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Michelangelo 5-Piece Stemless Wine Set, Decanter with 4 Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mghRVzPjL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Beautifully crafted glassware designed in Italy. Dishwasher safe yet beautiful enough for all of your entertainment needs, our stemware, tumblers and serveware allow you to experience fine Italian glassware while meeting the demands of your everyday life. Amazon.com Luigi Bormioli takes the classic Old World duck-shaped decanter and gives it a sleek, modern look for this gift set. The long angular \"neck\" cranes out to the side with a crisp, flat-edged rim, while the generous handle allows a good grasp for clean, careful pouring. Plenty of surface area inside the 25-ounce decanter lets fine red wine breathe before drinking. Included in the set are four 15-1/2-ounce contemporary wine glasses in the fashionable new stemless shape, which cradles sensuously in the hand and eliminates worries about stem breakage. Designed in Italy, the dishwasher-safe duck decanter and wine glasses are crafted from machine-blown, lead-free crystal. Without the lead, the crystalline glass eliminates health concerns about leaching and still exhibits an exceptional clarity, thanks to the high-silica, pure quartz sand used in the manufacturing process. Packaged in sturdy, colorfully designed boxes, Bormioli glassware makes gift-giving effortless for a housewarming, wedding, thank-you, graduation, or any other special event. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mghRVzPjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B000EN3WVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EN3WVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EN3WVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
