window.products.push({"id":755236,"name":"Tookich Silicone Stretch Lids, 6 Different Sizes, Umitive Round Food Covers, BPA Free, Reusable, Expandable Lids for Food Containers Storage Covers Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H1U9qZumL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As a professional kitchenware manufacturer, we pay attention to every small need in the kitchen. This silicone lid adopts European standards, which is higher than American standards, it's thickness has increased by more than 30%. It's more durable and can be reused. It not only facilitates food sealing, but also reduces the generation of plastic waste. Specification of silicone stretch lid: Material: Silicone Quantity: 6 Size: 8\" in diameter, Suitable for large salad bowls, mixing bowls, 1-gallon jars. 6.5\" in diameter, Suitable for oversized bowls, watermelons. 5.7\" in diameter, Suitable for small watermelon, soup bowl. 4.5\" in diameter, Suitable for cantaloupe, regular bowl, bento box, 1 quart jar. 3.7\" in diameter, Suitable for large yogurt, grapefruit, coffee cup, beer mug, small bowl. 2.6\" in diameter, Suitable for fruit cups, small yogurt, apples, canned soup. Why choose them? Safe & healthy silicone food lid The silicone stretch lid is made of food grade silicone. You only need to cover the food with a silicone lid, and then heat it in the oven or microwave. The temperature range is -40°F ~ 450°F. At the same time, silicone food lids are also safe in refrigerators and dishwashers. No leakage Silicone stretch lids have great elasticity, they can seal the container well, have a strong adsorption force, wont overflow or leak. Scope of application The silicone elastic lid contains 6 different sizes, so there is no need to worry about remaining food exposed in the air. The stretchable stretch lid is suitable for bowls, cups, jars, mason jars, glassware, watermelon, pineapple, cantaloupe or other fruits and vegetables. Different sizes and shapes can meet your various needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H1U9qZumL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tookich","source_asin":"B08FGK3CZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FGK3CZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FGK3CZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
