window.products.push({"id":755273,"name":"Kitsure Kitchen Mats for Cushioned Anti-Fatigue Use 2 PCS, Anti-Slip Kitchen Rugs, Easy-to-Clean and Comfortable Standing Desk Mats for Offices, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SXnWpFk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTI-FATIGUE & COMFORTABLE: The Kitsure kitchen rugs of 0.4-inch employ ergonomics which can efficiently relieve fatigue and improve blood circulation. Besides, the kitchen floor mats are supports and buffers between your feet and the hard ground when you need to stand long in any working area. Moreover, these kitchen floor mats with thick memory foam will protect fragile kitchenware such as bowls and dishes from breaking when falling on the mat. 【DURABLE & EASY TO CLEAN】 The kitchen mats with anti-fatigue designs are made of premium PVC, which is waterproof, oilproof, and stain-resistant. The durable material provides the fatigue mats for standing with longevity against deformation. Besides, the smooth surface enables you to clean the runner rugs for kitchen floor easily. You can just wipe off the stains with a damp cloth, or clean up the debris with a handheld vacuum. 【NON-SLIP & STEADY】 With the non-slip design, Kitsure anti-fatigue kitchen mats can provide great protection for kids and pets for standing. Moreover, the upgraded non-slip backing reduces the probability of sliding, making the rugs for kitchens suitable for various surfaces, such as planks, ceramics, laminate, marble, and concrete. (Note: Please place the kitchen rugs on DRY FLAT SURFACES.) 【RESILIENT & HIGH-QUALITY】 The two kitchen floor mats for in front of sink respectively measure 17.3''(W) x 30''(L) and 17.3''(W) x 47''(L), both sharing a thickness of 0.4 inch. The universal sizes enable them to be applied in most kinds of kitchens. You can place the two rugs anywhere freely according to the size of your kitchen. Moreover, with the upgraded material, these anti-fatigue kitchen mats will not bring any pungent odors when in use. 【STYLISH & MULTIPURPOSE】 The kitchen floor mats with fashionable square patterns and neutral tones can easily match any decor in different houses and kitchens. The versatile non-slip rugs for kitchen are suitable for both indoor and outdoor areas. They can not only be used as anti-fatigue mats in the kitchens, laundries, offices, farmhouses, or other working places, but also yoga mats for exercising, meeting your wide range of applications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SXnWpFk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitsure","source_asin":"B0BQLG4DPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQLG4DPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQLG4DPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
