window.products.push({"id":755471,"name":"McCulloch MC1350 Portable Power Steam Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sA4AoRW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The McCulloch MC1350 Portable Power Steam Cleaner provides hands-free, full-size performance on the go. Using ordinary water heated to over 200F, the MC1350 effectively and naturally cleans and sanitizes a wide variety of surfaces. Includes 15 versatile accessories. Custom steam control and 30 second heat up time helps you clean faster. Water Treatment Cartridge included to reduce mineral buildup and maintain premium performance. Continuous fill water tank lets you add water without the wait of cool down. Backed by a 1-year warranty and supported in Andover, Kansas. With over 50 years of experience in the design and manufacture of outdoor power equipment, McCulloch has established an unrivalled reputation for design, reliability and value in a wide range of outdoor, garden and workshop products. Model is made for 120 volts only. Amazon.com McCulloch MC1350 Portable Power Steam Cleaner The McCulloch MC1350 Portable Power Steam Cleaner provides hands-free, full-size performance on the go. Using ordinary water heated to over 200ºF, the MC1350 effectively and naturally cleans and sanitizes a wide variety of surfaces. With 15 versatile accessories, variable steam control and a continuous fill tank, the MC1350 is equipped for the toughest jobs. Quick Facts 30 Second Heat Up Time 50 Minutes of Continuous Steam 15 Accessories Perfect For Outdoor Furniture & Grills Outdoor Furniture & Grills Wheels, Engines & Interiors Wheels, Engines & Interiors Boats, RV’s & Motorcycles Boats, RV’s & Motorcycles Lawn Equipment & Tools Lawn Equipment & Tools Tile & Grout Tile & Grout Appliances & Fixtures Appliances & Fixtures Features Unique Backpack Design Removable backpack with comfortable shoulder straps provide for on-the-go cleaning. Heat Indicator Light Indicator light is red when unit is heating and turns green when ready to use. Continuous Fill Tank 42 oz. capacity continuous fill water tank allows for refills without the wait of cool down. Integrated Cord Wrap Neatly store the extra long 15' power cord using the integrated cord wrap. Variable Steam Control On-demand variable steam allows you to dial in precise steam flow. Scrubbing Power Use the versatile scrub pads and utility brushes to tackle tough dirt and grime. 4' Insulated Hose The insulated steam hose safely channels the flow of steam to the steam nozzle and provides for easy reach. Clean Naturally Ordinary water, heated to over 200ºF, effectively cleans with no harsh chemicals or artificial scents. Great for auto, RV and boat cleaning jobs.  Utility brushes provide extra scrubbing power.  Clean windows and mirrors with the squeegee. Product Comparison MC1350 Portable Power Steam Cleaner MC1375 Canister Steam System MC1385 Deluxe Canister Steam System Size Backpack Canister Canister Accessories 15 20 23 Heat Up Time 30 sec. 10 min. 12 min. Max Steam Time 50 min. 90 min. 120 min. Max Steam Pressure 15-20 psi 58 psi 58 psi Tank Size 42 oz. 48 oz. 64 oz. Variable Steam Yes Yes Yes Mop No Yes Yes Steam Hose Length 4 ft. 10 ft. 10 ft. Weight 6 lbs. 10.78 lbs. 13 lbs. Height 15.88 in. 10.5 in. 19.05 in. Length 6.6 in. 15.55 in. 13.1 in. Width 8.75 in. 12.13 in. 13.35 in. Watts 1200 1500 1500 Volts 120V 120V 120V Power Cord Length 15 ft. 18 ft. 18 ft. What's Included Portable Steam Cleaner Portable Steam Cleaner Removable Backpack Removable Backpack 3\" Scrapper 3\" Scrapper 9\" Squeegee 9\" Squeegee 4\" Triangle Brush 4\" Triangle Brush 6\"x4.5\" Large Brush 6\"x4.5\" Large Brush Jet Nozzle Jet Nozzle 2.5\" Round Scrub Pad (2) 2.5\" Round Scrub Pad (2) 1.5\" Nylon Utility Brush (2) 1.5\" Nylon Utility Brush (2) 1.5\" Brass Utility Brush 1.5\" Brass Utility Brush 2.5\" Round Brush 2.5\" Round Brush Water Treatment Cartridge Water Treatment Cartridge Storage Bag and Fill Cup Storage Bag and Fill Cup Why McCulloch Steam McCulloch has a long tradition of developing powerful products, from its introduction of the first one-man chainsaw in 1949 to garden products for consumers in the 1970's. For nearly a decade, McCulloch has been building reliable, versatile, and powerful steam cleaning products that bring a heavy duty approach to the often \"soft\" world of steam cleaning. From small yet powerful handhelds to hulking canisters that crank out an unbelievable 2 hours of continuous steam, you will not find a more powerful, more versatile line of steam products. Anywhere. Period. From the Manufacturer IMPORTANT INTERNATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This item is built to meet U.S. voltage requirements and may not function properly when used in conjunction with external devices that alter or convert voltage or frequency of electricity. Improper use or shipping the product outside the U.S. will void all warranties. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sA4AoRW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"McCulloch","source_asin":"B00G00BT1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G00BT1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G00BT1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
