window.products.push({"id":755477,"name":"Personalized Custom Pug Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Men Women Kids Babies Blankets Perfect for Bedtime Bedding Gifts Pugs Lovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LJdhREYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LJdhREYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07RWPZWGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RWPZWGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RWPZWGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755478,"name":"Baxton Studio Zeller Button Tufted Modern Bed with Upholstered Headboard, Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgVpmgC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Restful sleep and style packed into one sleek package: our Zeller Designer Bed brings the best of both worlds. Attractive soft matte white faux leather upholsters this queen-sized platform bed, which includes wooden slats, thereby eliminating the need for a box spring. The Zeller Contemporary Bed also features foam padding, a button-tufted headboard and chrome-plated steel legs at the end of the bed. Maintenance is effortless: just wipe the bed's surfaces with a damp cloth before wiping dry. The Zeller Bed is also available in gray and black (each sold separately). Assembly is required. 38.66 Inch high x 65.75 Inch wide x 83 Inch long. Features: - Contemporary platform bed (requires only a mattress; wooden slats included) - Queen size - Engineered wood frame - White faux leather upholstery with foam padding - Chrome-plated steel legs with non-marking feet (footboard) - Legs extend downward from the upholstered footboard and are completed with non-marking feet (headboard) - Assembly required - Wipe clean with a damp cloth - Available in white, gray and black (each sold separately).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgVpmgC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B01E9WS0MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E9WS0MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E9WS0MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
