window.products.push({"id":755501,"name":"Maison Atlas Velvet Quilt Set, Charlotte Premium Heavy Velvet Collection, Cotton Backing, Cotton Batting, King, Dark Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hjJdDQ3HL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","description":"Why Maison Atlas is the best Velvet Collection in the market? 1. Velvet: Softest heavy velvet, timeless fabric of luxury and high life, awakens the sense of joy with every glance and touch. 2. Construction: True stitch embroidery, cotton backing, cotton filling, zippered pillows and shams. For comparison, our full queen size velvet quilt weights about 10 lbs. That is inline or better than what you would get from the high-end retailers and boutiques. The weight provides better drape and upscale feel for the whole space. 3. Dimensional look: Embroidered pieces feature %100 Cotton filling that “pops”. Combined with the natural sheen of the velvet, these pieces will bring a lively look to your home. 4. Ensemble: Two embroidery designs, Charlotte, Jewel and solid pieces, to suit every design style: transitional, modern, traditional, French country, English mansion, Italian villa, boho, midcentury, cottage, loft and many more. Complementary pieces to dress your space: quilt, window panel (grommet/rod pocket/back tab), sham (euro/king/standard), throw pillow, bolster pillow and throw. 5. Colors: Pearl white, Blue green slate, Burgundy, Light gray, Dark gray, Navy. Free fabric swatches available as quality and color samples, while supplies last. 6. Care: Easy care, Machine wash. 7. Value: Small batch designer quality, at great prices, delivered to your door. 8. Responsible, sustainable production. 9. Good at works: A portion of the proceeds are dedicated for social causes 10. Service: We are a small family company with 30+ years of combined textiles experience. We stand behind our products. Buy with confidence. “A Thing of Beauty Is a Joy Forever.” #MaisonAtlas","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hjJdDQ3HL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maison Atlas","source_asin":"B07K16Z2P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K16Z2P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K16Z2P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
