window.products.push({"id":755513,"name":"Bamboo Kitchen Drawer Dividers – Pack Of 4 Expandable Drawer Organizers Adjustable Drawer Organization Separators For Kitchen, Bedroom, Bathroom,Dress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fg9BhSQVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【MULTIPURPOSE DRAWER DIVIDERS】 These drawer organizers can be installed in any drawer of your house. For example, you can install them as silverware and utensil drawer organizers for your kitchen, towel or makeup drawer organizers for your bathroom and even in your office. 【EXPANDABLE AND ADJUSTABLE DESIGN】 Our desk drawer organizers come in packs of 4 and each one 17.3 to 22 inches long. You can therefore extend the baby clothes dividers and adjust them to the size of any drawer in your house or office. 【EASY INSTALLATION & REMOVAL】Each drawer divider has a built in spring to keep them in place and easy adjustment to meet your changing needs 【WELL DESIGN AND PREMIUM MATERIAL】Made with the highest quality 100% natural bamboo,Both ends of the divider are applied with rubber pads to protect your drawer and also the organizer itself. 【PERFECT GIFT IDEA】This is a wonderful gift idea for you and your friends' Housewarming gift/ Christmas gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fg9BhSQVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKKAJJ","source_asin":"B08BZHHFFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZHHFFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZHHFFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755514,"name":"Manual Inspirational Collection Tapestry Throw with Verse, Broken Silence by Kevin Daniel, 60 X 50-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JgEWe-IZL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JgEWe-IZL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B003OY6IVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003OY6IVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003OY6IVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
