window.products.push({"id":755520,"name":"imarku Butcher Knife, 10 Inch Carving Knife, Sharp Breaking Cimitar Meat Knife, Japanese Stainless Steel, Full Tang Pakkawood Handle with Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zzS13a9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST PARTNER: imarku 10-inch butcher knife is a meat knife commonly used by butchers and professional chefs, butcher knife is professionally designed and made, which can easily cut meat, pierce cartilage and cleverly remove fat, helping you easily tackle all kinds of hard-to-handle meats. For the busy butcher, this is the best choice. TIP DESIGN: Designed with a scalpel-like curved blade, this scimitar knife creates leverage to complete the cut in a smooth fashion without sawing. Unique non-stick food design on the blade can provide the least cutting resistance.We use new technology to make knives, this carving knife can reach an initial sharpness value of 110, the ultimate international standard. EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP: Butcher knife is made of imported Japanese SUS440A Stainless Steel, which is rust-proof and corrosion-resistant. Hand-forged by craftsmen with more than 20 years of experience, vacuum heat treatment to improve sharpness and rust resistance. Full Tang design, three-layer rivet technology, further increase the strength of the carving knife. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The Pakkawood handle minimizes wrist tension while providing a secure, comfortable grip no matter your hand size or where you grip. Even after prolonged use, your palm and wrist will not fatigue. Every detail reflects imarku carving knife's heart. QUALITY ASSURANCE: We only make products that professional chefs and home chefs love and trust, with a 100% satisfaction or money-back guarantee and risk-free trial, this is the reason why millions of chefs choose imarku' knives. The breaking knife is placed in a high-quality black gift box, making it the perfect gift for whoever you love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zzS13a9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imarku","source_asin":"B094JCD237","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094JCD237","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094JCD237","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
