window.products.push({"id":755543,"name":"HQRP 2-pack Foam and Felt Filter Kit compatible with Shark Navigator NV36 NV36A NV36_26 NV36A_26 NV42 NV42_26 Upright Vacuum Cleaners, XF22 Replacemen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-OMQB81+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Compatible with Shark Navigator NV36 / NV36_26, NV36A / NV36A_26, NV42 / NV42_26 Upright Vacuum Cleaners, part XF22 Replacement. One package contains 2 Foam Circular Filters, 1 Felt Circular Filter, 1 Felt Exhaust Filter. The vacuum uses all 4 filters at once. It's recommended to wash the circular foam and felt filters every 30 days, and replace it after 3-4 washes, and replace woven exhaust filter every 6 months. Let air dry completely before replacing. Do not operate the vacuum with wet filters! !!! The models NV42, NV36, NV36A can be supplied with different filters. Before making a purchase please make sure your filter looks exactly like the one on the photo. If your original filter has a hole inside, our filter will not work with your vacuum cleaner. The filters capture household dust, and other particles preventing them from recirculating into the air. Made of high quality material, these replacement filters are long-lasting and work efficiently in your Navigator Vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-OMQB81+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HQRP","source_asin":"B06Y8THLYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y8THLYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y8THLYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755544,"name":"Sensory Decisions Frankincense and Myrrh Fragrance Room Spray - Frankincense & Myrrh Scented Home Spray - Frankincense and Myrrh Scent (1 Bottle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713fsGafgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OVERVIEW: A traditional Christmasm scent in an atomiser spray! This product is a concentrated Frankincense & Myrrh fragrance that smells amazing all year round. INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE: Indoor use: spray a few pumps into the centre of the room with the bottle upright. Avoid contact with polished surfaces, fabrics and soft furnishings before testing on an inconspicuous area first. Automotive application: After emptying, cleaning and vacuuming your car, spray the carpets, footwell mats and boot-liner liberally. If necessary, also sparingly spray head liners and seat covers. Replace mats and preferably leave for a few hours (or overnight). For intensive results, also spray sparingly down the air vents and leave to dry. PRECAUTIONS: Always test in an inconspicuous area before spraying direct onto materials or surfaces. In spite of how great it smells, this is not suitable for eating, cooking or use as a flavouring. Not for application to the body. Always follow instructions. BOTTLE SIZE AND HOW LONG IT LASTS: Each bottle contains 50ml of long-lasting fragrance. The non-aerosol atomiser releases 0.14ml per actuation. There are nearly 360 actuations per bottle and typically only 2 - 3 are required per use. ABOUT THIS PRODUCT RANGE: This product is part of the \"Home & Indoors Collection\" from Sensory Decisions, featuring a range of singular scents and fragrance blends. This Collection also includes Fresh Linen, Lavender, White Musk and more. Other collections from Sensory Decisions include: the Automotive Collection (New Car Smell, Leather, His & Hers), Nature & Outdoors Collection (Freshly Cut Grass, Sandalwood, Frangipani and more) the Culinary Collection (including Bread, Coffee, Popcorn, Chocolate, Bacon) and the Clothing Collection. A product range map is included in the product images for this listing and shows the current fragrance spray product range.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713fsGafgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sensory Decisions","source_asin":"B01KYLSZG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KYLSZG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KYLSZG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
