window.products.push({"id":755653,"name":"BalsaCircle 10-Inch Tall Black Silk Artificial Peony Flowers Bouquet Wedding Reception Centerpieces Arrangements Decorations Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YmY4MzKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREE SHIPPING on orders $75 and more. Decorate your special day with silk peony flowers from Balsa Circle! Full and beautiful peony flowers are made with great attention to details making them an excellent addition to your own projects and designs. Use them in a bridal bouquet or make a custom centerpiece. The fresh-picked look of these high-quality silk peonies flowers will complete your wedding flower arrangements and delight your guests.  WHAT YOU GET: Each order is for one (1) bouquet. There are 5 peony flowers, 3 leaves and 8 stems in 1 bouquet.Measurements: Entire bouquet size: approx. 10 inches tall x 7 inches wide.Flower size: approx. 3.5 inches wide.Stem size: approx. 7 inches tall.Leaf size: approx. 4 inches long x 4.5 inches wide.Material: Silk.Can be used individually or in bunches. Other decorations are not included.Upon arrival, we recommend removing the flowers from the packaging and allowing them to expand. We also recommend steaming the flowers, so that they fluff up and take their full form. Get the party planning started and add them to your cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YmY4MzKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BalsaCircle Arificial Flowers","source_asin":"B08WC2TQJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WC2TQJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WC2TQJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755654,"name":"Cervical Memory Foam Pillows, Neck Pillow for Shoulder and Neck Pain Relief Sleeping, Unique Design Contour Support Bed Pillow for Back Stomach Side S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ciBEy9djL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE BUTTERFLY PILLOW - This unique design cervical pillow for neck pain is ergonomically designed to help support and align your head, neck, shoulders and back in a neutral position. The side sleeper pillows for neck and shoulder pain relief, improves sleep and rejuvenates the body. The orthopedic pillow features are combined in various ways to address the many different sleep preferences people have. Whether you sleep on your back, stomach or side sleeper that neck pillow is comfortable. ERGONOMIC NECK PILLOWS FOR PAIN RELIEF SLEEPING - The bed pillow for neck and shoulder pain will uniquely match the shape of your head, neck and arms, with sides that fit side sleepers and support them tightly. The 2 different height profiles adapt to the natural curvature of the body, keeping the air passages optimal, reducing snoring and allowing for a more restful sleep. - The size of the cervical pillow are 25.59*12.6*5.12 /5.52 inches. 5S SLOW REBOUND MEMORY FOAM PILLOW - The neck support pillow is made of high quality 100% memory foam, while the contour pillow is made of medium firmness using 70D density memory foam for better support. You can rest assured that you will have a cool and sweet dream! | Please do not touch the memory foam insert of the pillow with water. WASHABLE PILLOW COVER - The neck pillow cover feels silky soft using 3D breathable cotton + 70% polyester + 30% cotton. All materials are breathable, skin friendly and chemical free for better health. 3D breathable pillowcases allow heat to escape and fresh air to circulate in so you can rest without feeling hot or uncomfortable, keeping you cool and dry. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - The orthopedic pillow is the perfect gift for New Years, birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mothers Day, Fathers Day, weddings and graduations. The ergonomic pillow helps to reduce neck problems and improve your sleep effectively and is definitely a great choice! What's more, we also give you an EYE MASK and EARPLUGS so that you can have a more restful sleep. If you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us within 24 hours and provide worry-free after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ciBEy9djL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemonfish","source_asin":"B0B2WFG9DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2WFG9DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2WFG9DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
