window.products.push({"id":755687,"name":"AKKTOL Electric Spin Scrubber, Cordless Cleaning Brush with 6 Replaceable Waterproof Brush Heads, Up to 300RPM, 1.5H Runtime, Extension Arm, Power Sho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F7RZKkZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【74W Powerful Motor & 2-speed Adjustment】The electric cleaning brush scrubber’s power is 74w, which is more powerful than others’ 7w to 24w. A strong motor drives the brush head to rotate at a low speed at 250RPM and a high speed at 300RPM to provide different cleaning requirements. 💞To remove stubborn stains, please use them with detergent.💞 ✨【6 Replaceable IPX7 Waterproof Brush Heads】The electric spin scrubber can effectively clean the bathtub, bathroom, floor, corner, glass, and other scenes. You can always find the most appropriate brush to clean target places. The attached hanging hook is convenient for storage. Just hang the product up with the hook when not in use. ✨【Convenient Type-C Interface & Cordless】Our electric bathroom scrubber is equipped with Type-C Interface (charger NOT included). Compatible with almost all USB-C devices, no need to worry about finding a charger and being unable to charge. Running about 90 minutes after 3.5 hours of fast charging. The electric bathroom scrubber gets rid of the long wires, and you can use it to clean any corner of the room very conveniently. ✨【Safe Cleaning】While the spin scrubber shouldn’t be completely submerged in water, it resists splashes. it's recommended to remove the brush head separately for cleaning. For a better cleaning effect, please spray the cleaner on the stains before you clean with the electric brush. (pls do not immerse the whole machine in the water). ✨【Adjustable Length & Angle】The electric shower scrubber brush heads are equipped with 3 adjustable angles. Choose the cleaning angle that saves you the most effort and shortens the cleaning time, freeing you from the backbreaking cleaning work. The handle extends from 23.5 inches to 50.4 inches easy to clean hard-to-reach places. ✨【Best Quality & Best Gift for Your Family】It's an ideal gift for friends, parents and wife. AKKTOL electric bathroom scrubber is committed to the best customer experience and product quality. 💞We provide a 30-day hassle-free money-back, 1-year quality guarantee. Pls fully charge the electric scrubber before use after receiving the product, which can make sure it functions perfectly. Please tell us if you have any requests, and we will solve your problem within 24 hours.💞","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F7RZKkZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKKTOL","source_asin":"B0C65FR2X6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65FR2X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65FR2X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":755688,"name":"ESPOIR & AMOUR Dragon's Blood Sage - 3 Spiritual Dragon Blood Sage Sticks for Smudging, Healing and Ritual | Sustainably Harvested 4 Inch Red Sage Smu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z3JPehSBL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Cleanse your aura and protect your personal energy with Espoir and Amour Dragon Blood Sage Smudge Stick! Espoir and Amour is a female-owned business, anchored by a passion for helping those with stressful, modern-day lifestyles to find inner peace. Sisters Humara and Farhana founded Espoir and Amour whilst embarking on their own spiritual journeys. After finding calmness and strength in their own healing journeys, having been through challenging times in their lives, they feel it's their turn to give back. By bringing their own Native American red dragon blood sage bundle to you, they are spreading the word of the life-changing benefits red sage smudge sticks for cleansing home have to offer! They'd love for you to join them! Experience the amazing benefits of our Blood Red Sage Sticks for Cleansing House Negative Energy in a few simple steps... 1. Hold your red burnable sage at a 45° angle2. Allow several seconds for the flame to properly smoulder3. Once lit, hold upwards and gently blow on embers to encourage a smooth, continuous burn 4. Waft smoke through your home, recite a mantra or maintain a calm intention5. Once you're finished, place your sage in your Espoir and Amour Abalone Shell to burn out peacefullyIncorporate age-old ritual into your spiritual healing routine with our dragons blood sage for cleansing house. With sustainability placed high at the top of our priorities, all of our sage bundles for smudging have been sustainably harvested, with our dragons blood sage being hand-tied and picked in California. Why not gift negative energy relief to the spiritual individual in your life? Perhaps someone who has recently started a new beginning? One thing's for sure, they'll love this thoughtful red sage for smudging and negative energy!Inspire, Heal and Empower, one Espoir and Amour Dragons Blood Sage to Burn for Cleansing 3 Pack at a time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z3JPehSBL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESPOIR & AMOUR","source_asin":"B0B8Q49DC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8Q49DC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8Q49DC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
