window.products.push({"id":755690,"name":"KUAYIXIA Heated Electric Throw Blanket Twin, Soft Flannel to Sherpa Reversible Fast Warming Heater Blankets Electric, Washable Heating Blanket Throw 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YdGrEcBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Newest Heating Technology: Heated throws adopt advanced processing to offer you instant warmth on chilly days. Hidden heating wires are laid in U-shape for even heat distribution and exquisite elegant appearance suits perfectly the setting of your room. Intelligent Controller Setting: Please rest assured to use the heating blanket throw which has passed ETL and FCC certification. Small electric blanket equips with a controller which has 10 heat levels (96°F-122°F) to meet different comfort needs. 3 set timer(2/4/8hours)-The electric heating blanket is specially designed with over-heating protection and shuts off automatically after the selected timing to avoid accidents and save energy, allowing you to sleep securely in chilly weather. Premium Material: Twin size heated blanket are made of silky 330GSM flannel and 220GSM sherpa lining which is thicker than other products to offer you excellent warmth preservation and optimal comfort. Our heat blanket will become a perfect partner in the cold winter. The evenly distributed heating wires can heat up faster and brings you warmth in a short time. Multiple Functions: Portable heated blanket comes with a 7ft long power cord that makes it to be used flexibly. Ideal for use on the couch, sofa, bed, or to wrap up while watching tv, reading a book, or office. It can also be used as a normal blanket by simply detaching the controller. Machine Washable & Easy Care: Please unplug the heating controller and power cables. Wash this electric heated blanket by hand or machine by following the guide on User Manual. Machine wash under 40°C/104°F to maintain its best condition. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We will do our utmost to solve it for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YdGrEcBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUAYIXIA","source_asin":"B09DPWD8Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPWD8Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPWD8Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
