window.products.push({"id":755719,"name":"Erbulus 18 Oz Large Turkish Coffee Pot - Briki Greek, Arabic, Turkish Coffee Maker with Wooden Handle, 6 persons Hammered Cezve Ibrik Brik - Stovetop ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lWFWvfDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turkish coffee pot, also known as Arabic coffee pot or briki Greek coffee pot is made entirely of copper. It is widely used as a set with Turkish coffee cups in all cultures. Copper working is the shaping of copper using various techniques. Copper working is one of the important Turkish handcraft fields. Various techniques are used to shape copper such as wrought, engraving, and wrought with nail. Copper merchandise are created by the copper and brass metals. The attribute of copper is to be produced as one-piece, it implies that there is no patch or comparable jointing techniques. Today, copper mining objects are generally utilized in home, kitchen and as a decoration. As well as all kinds of daily kitchen items such as cookers, pots, pitchers, cauldrons, trays, glasses and carrying containers, imitations of historical copper objects, decorative copper objects, paintings and copper name plates are also produced. Other than the basic copper item preparing, different cycle is performed with a sledge and steel pen just in Gaziantep/Turkey. In this preparing technique, improvement of a solitary piece here and there takes weeks or even months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lWFWvfDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erbulus","source_asin":"B09L1FNQ3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L1FNQ3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L1FNQ3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
