window.products.push({"id":755736,"name":"HUMIDIMASTER 2023 6L Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Rooms, 1.6 Gallon Top Fill Ultrasonic Humidifier, Quiet Effective for Home - 60 hours, 36","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YIEDjsajL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60 WORKING HOURS & INSTANT DRY AIR RELIEF — Our Lazy Pro humidifier has a large capacity 1.6-gallon water tank that will last up to 7 nights per fill or 60 hours of continuous operation. Ideal humidifiers for large room as it easily covers up to 500 sq. ft. with its powerful mist for comfortable relief from dry air damage. The cool ultrasonic mist will quickly and safely moisturize dry air and alleviate cough, dry skin, wrinkles, insomnia, sinus headaches, snoring and nosebleeds. BEST HUMIDIFIER FOR BEDROOM Customize your mist - Choose your preferred cool mist level from 3 working modes with just one touch and balance and regulate the humidity from 40% to 90% to suit your needs. Now you can control the environment in extremely dry and/or dusty rooms or just moderately dehydrated with our air humidifier. Create an ideal indoor climate for your house, plants, and office, and enjoy fresh, easy-to-breathe air all day. WHISPER QUIET IDEAL FOR BABIES & PLANTS — No rattle or hum noises! Our cool mist humidifiers at 30 dB in sleep mode are quieter than a whisper. It offers a great night's sleep with zero disturbance, making it ideal humidifiers for baby. Use theLazy Pro humidifier to ensure an even humidity level and reduce the risk of diseases, germs, and bacteria for a safe environment for your kids. Also, our humidifiers will automatically shut off when the water level is low to provide extra safety. 360° MULTIDIRECTIONAL MIST OUTPUT —Lazy Pro humidifiers for bedroom have a 360° rotating nozzle that can be directed in any desired direction to efficiently humidify any space. You can aim the mist towards your bed for a night of better sleep or at indoor plants to moisturize them and prevent them from drying out. Now, you can enjoy the moisture from every corner of your bedroom, nursery or office. SAFE MEDICAL STONE FILTER — Our Lazy Pro humidifiers come with a medical stone filter that purifies water and prevents impurities or bacteria from developing in the water tank. Enjoy the benefits of humidifiers for bedroom all day and night without worrying about germs that can harm you and your kids. Now, your air will be clean and comfortably humidified! CONVENIENT TOP FILL & EASY TO CLEAN —Simply remove the air humidifier's lid and pour cool water into the water tank, and you are done! The construction of our cool mist humidifier is completely spill-proof, so no more water puddles to take care of. Clean the tank every 2-3 weeks with mild dish detergent and warm water to ensure a fresh air mist. RELAXING AROMATHERAPY: Please be careful not to drop essential oil directly into the tank to avoid damage to it. You can add your favorite essential oils to the aroma box and enjoy wonderful, fresh-smelling air","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YIEDjsajL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lazy Pro","source_asin":"B0C69P31GC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69P31GC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69P31GC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
