window.products.push({"id":755854,"name":"Create from your Heart by Susan Rios, 35x35-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KQNsu5LHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a still life of birds and flowers filling the frame.Serene settings, gentle harmonies, soft, inviting rooms, lush, floral gardens, quiet seas that Evoke tranquility I1/2 artist Susan Riosi1/2 distinctive style is evident in every image she paints. We are drawn in by the love and Peace depicted in each painting, uplifted both visually and emotionally. It is as if Susan has personally invited us into her private places, allowing us to linger there, partaking of the scene.Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KQNsu5LHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0721QKD8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0721QKD8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0721QKD8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
