window.products.push({"id":755914,"name":"Tangkula Lift Top Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment & 2 Side Drawers, Modern Wood Lift Tabletop Dining Table for Living Reception Room Office, Meta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BfF7nfn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Our lift top coffee table offers versatile uses. Equipped with heavy-duty metal hydraulic lifting mechanism, the table top can be lifted up and down smoothly and silently while holding lots of items at least of 77lbs. Several crash pads on the table frame can avoid damages caused by excessive impact.You can adjust the top to your desired height so that you can use it comfortably. There are two large side drawers and a hidden storage compartment beneath the top, providing sufficient storage space for your items. With the lifting function, this table can be used as a desk to work and study or a dining table for family meals. A certain height from the ground is spacious enough for sweeping robots to get in. Made of selected MDF and engineered wood, this coffee table features sturdy construction for long-term use. Feature Equipped with smooth, silent and stable metal hydraulic lifting mechanismCrash pads on the corners of table frame prevent damages caused by excessive impact 2 side drawers and hidden compartment offers ample storage space Handles and smooth slide make convenience for opening drawers Lift top can be moved to your accommodate height for wider use Multipurpose table has versatile uses for working, reading and dining Modern and simple style to match various room decors Waterproof surface can be clean easily by cloth Specification Color: Black/ White Material: MDF, Engineered WoodMetal Overall Dimensions: 47” x 23.5” x 15.5”(L X W X H)Net Weight: 57.5lbs Maximum Weight of Tabletop: 200.5lbsMaximum Weight of Lift Table: 77lbsMaximum Weight of Drawer: 11lbsMaximum Weight of Storage Cabinet: 22lbsPackage includes: 1 x Lift Top Coffee Table","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BfF7nfn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B09P556D8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-755914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P556D8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P556D8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
